  "content": "<h1><img src=\"https://cdn-raw.modrinth.com/data/6uJCfiCH/0b4983e0ba8cac6ffe2cc5c2076a8a6b0b28fd1f.png\" alt=\"Spooklementary_logo\" width=\"60\" height=\"auto\"> &nbsp; Spooklementary</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/5N45SAsC3X\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Static Badge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/discord-white?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=rgb(210, 106, 6)&label=加入&labelColor=rgb(4, 11, 20)&color=rgb(210, 106, 6)\">\n</a>\n&nbsp;\n<img alt=\"Static Badge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/iris, optifine, oculus | 1.7.10 至最新版本-white?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&label=支持&labelColor=rgb(4, 11, 20)&color=rgb(210, 106, 6)\">\n&nbsp;\n<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/SpacEagle17\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Static Badge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/spaceagle17-white?style=for-the-badge&logo=patreon&logoColor=rgb(210, 106, 6)&label=支持&labelColor=rgb(4, 11, 20)&color=rgb(210, 106, 6)&link=https://patreon.com/spaceagle17\">\n</a></p>\n<h2>什么是 Spooklementary？</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Spooklementary 由 SpacEagle17 制作，是对 EminGT 的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.complementary.dev%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Complementary Shaders</a> 的修改版本。</li>\n<li>这是一款恐怖主题的着色器包，将你的游戏体验转变为充满氛围和惊悚感的旅程。</li>\n<li>非常适合万圣节或恐怖地图！点击页面顶部的“画廊”查看截图。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>重要提示：请勿向 Emin 报告此插件的 Bug，而请通过 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/5N45SAsC3X\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> 向我报告。</strong></p>\n<h2>链接</h2>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/SpacEagle17\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7f94a4d0b4854a694e1b3dbb5aa8e42fc15bce89.png\" alt=\"Patreon\">\n    <br><br>\n  </a>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li>SpacEagle17 的 <strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/5N45SAsC3X\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><ins>Discord</ins></a></strong> 服务器，用于讨论、提问和建议……</li>\n<li>在 <strong><a href=\"https://twitter.com/SpacEagle17\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><ins>Twitter/X</ins></a></strong> 上关注 SpacEagle17，获取着色器包的最新消息</li>\n</ul>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><span><span><iframe style=\"width:655px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/CndrX1R5boQ\" width=\"455\" height=\"384\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></div>\n<h2>由 Ember Host 赞助</h2>\n<p>正在寻找经济实惠且可靠的 Minecraft 服务器主机？Ember Host 提供极具性价比的服务和顶级技术支持！</p>\n<p>点击横幅或在结账时使用代码 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fember-referral\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EUPHORIA</a></strong> 可享首单 <strong>10%</strong> 折扣。此外，您的购买金额中有 <strong>70%</strong> 将支持 Euphoria Patches！</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fember-referral\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/545bcc6a4800cae3bace3a58a06e0dab9eccf9e4_0.webp\"></a></p>",
